[{"title":"四景 其一","author":"孙伟","text":"野构延新霁，轻云放远山。\n酒添花木气，春与性情閒。\n养拙无多事，浮生有笑颜。\n鸟声浑识意，只在钓矶湾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29022,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四景 其二","author":"孙伟","text":"短榻横清暇，南山过雨痕。\n薰风生草末，积水浸云根。\n蕙思虚瑶瑟，菱歌近酒樽。\n但知真乐在，相忆复谁言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29023,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四景 其三","author":"孙伟","text":"九秋风色澹，水落练花潭。\n十步有芳酌，一茅还旧龛。\n南山今昨是，夜菊醉醒甘。\n怀愤义熙后，谁将此意参。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29024,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四景 其四","author":"孙伟","text":"嵓栖寡俦匹，幽思渺难裁。\n雪阵寒初阁，江光晚未开。\n转空闻语屑，锵韵上琴台。\n日暮看犹落，渔翁罢钓回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29025,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠黎侍御巡按四川 其一","author":"孙伟","text":"蜀雨巫云不碍山，使君亲度万重关。\n秋花尚惜芙蓉锦，川路频驱横石顽。\n拄笏独临飞鸟上，写诗多寄翠微间。\n金乌踏遍行台柏，骢马遥归十二闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29026,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠黎侍御巡按四川 其二","author":"孙伟","text":"爱君诗思逼长江，且酌霜英醉小窗。\n烛里谈锋新拔垒，墀头簪笔旧如杠。\n沧洲吊影冥鸿独，霄汉连城白璧双。\n西去岷山更西路，有人饥渴拜旌幢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29027,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日 其一","author":"孙伟","text":"鼓角喧春岁已除，雪花如掌遍郊墟。\n屠苏又醉王正月，童子不嫌吾旧庐。\n江曙忽惊山亦老，梅寒真与鹤添臞。\n农人爱此占年事，莫向边关洒泪馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29028,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日 其二","author":"孙伟","text":"梅花喜见一枝横，瓦雀连声报晓晴。\n三日泥穿东郭履，六年人住楚江城。\n川融石水源源动，林晏春云处处生。\n满面条风吹不断，閤山晴雪笠边明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29029,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨应吴太参二首 其一","author":"孙伟","text":"谁挽天河四月翻，山云晓护使君轩。\n蒲葵半亩青红湿，鸂鶒满塘黄浊喧。\n塍溜暗添秧下水，庖烟远驻竹边村。\n怒雷莫促乖龙急，枯槁惟宜霢霂恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29030,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨应吴太参二首 其二","author":"孙伟","text":"坐听檐虚泻沸涛，也知真宰养民膏。\n北窗梦觉增絺绤，南亩人归罢桔槔。\n乡赛入村喧社鼓，野塘生水受渔舠。\n雨师先及公田足，为报官家抚字劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29031,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四夜月","author":"孙伟","text":"夜久谁家旧镜悬，清光仍欠一分圆。\n吴刚不解斲轮意，李白虚传问月篇。\n兔影斜含丹桂陌，鸾声细堕白榆烟。\n玉楼仙梦今非昨，天步云骖付少年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29032,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五夜月","author":"孙伟","text":"圆魄初升万象奇，霁光先泛碧梧枝。\n清虚露堕疑蟾泣，沧海书来讶凤迟。\n灵谷山高曾对酒，洞庭秋好记题诗。\n广寒仙乐开香宴，法喜应拈玉笛吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29033,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日游慧力寺 其一","author":"孙伟","text":"清风两袂度禅关，绕槛苍松记旧攀。\n寒溜静依双涧在，白云长占一邱閒。\n酒酣送客迷江畔，兴至穿林坐竹间。\n欲向定中谈出入，老禅惟看寺前山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29034,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日游慧力寺 其二","author":"孙伟","text":"村径萧萧二里长，寻幽翻讶与僧忙。\n竹廊旧忆题诗处，莲社新开选佛场。\n落日疏钟遥渡水，晚风黄叶暗惊霜。\n忽从伏马桥边过，往事今因尽可伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29035,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"颍江归自南昌","author":"孙伟","text":"愁君远道迷风雨，邂逅忽随风雨归。\n应为高堂念行李，却从渔父借蓑衣。\n昆虫岁晚闭关早，鸿雁江寒接羽稀。\n天地悭贤于子极，且须时命向荆扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29036,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"孙伟","text":"露下青枫暑未归，响空环佩转轻微。\n星宫一岁□□□，□□□□□□□。\n□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。\n□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29037,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎春柬徐太守","author":"孙伟","text":"霁烟初放鸟初鸣，万户春迎太守行。\n人把阴晴占百谷，天教风雨避双旌。\n江湖水动鱼思泳，山路寒轻木向荣。\n莫讶土牛喧鼓板，厥明辛苦是鞭声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29038,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别廖汝谦","author":"孙伟","text":"一自狂歌有去舟，陇云巴月溯河流。\n剑光远射峨眉雪，客思閒消鹦鹉洲。\n乡国又逢听雨夜，天涯重忆寄书秋。\n征衫尚带闻猿泪，笑拂风尘季子裘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29039,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过石江子","author":"孙伟","text":"檐外江声落酒卮，老夫携伴过邻时。\n醉醒只在荒城住，忧乐空烦短鬓知。\n白璧夜光谁按剑，绿琴心远自调丝。\n清谈绝倒炉熏畔，野性年来似鹿麋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29040,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中三首 其一","author":"孙伟","text":"尽日高斋听雨眠，数声春燕语梁边。\n旧矶水涨知多少，一夜清江阻钓船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29041,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中三首 其二","author":"孙伟","text":"石竹丛阴路不乾，晚移残兴看春澜。\n落花风里无人迹，细雨谁怜翡翠寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29042,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中三首 其三","author":"孙伟","text":"阶前楚尾湿毵毵，屏下红灯照暮龛。\n莫怪山人诗作癖，却胜春雨忆江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29043,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画","author":"孙伟","text":"村底閒门面石开，青山如画水如苔。\n白云久作孤舟伴，流过清溪渡口来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29044,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山房小隐","author":"孙伟","text":"此身天地一筇长，语笑含风草树香。\n莫道入山绝人境，山前十里是柴桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29045,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送许给事中启衷使交趾二首 其一","author":"熊卓","text":"春明发车骑，合沓集川原。\n美人使绝域，相送东郭门。\n君去岂徒然，能令中国尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29046,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送许给事中启衷使交趾二首 其二","author":"熊卓","text":"邈矣南荒地，于今过使君。\n蛮王拜帝敕，草木识人文。\n日月舆图外，应歌铜柱勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29047,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见新燕有怀","author":"熊卓","text":"城隅有高馆，宴坐常寂寥。\n海燕及春来，双飞还旧巢。\n昔去谁所迫，今来谁所邀。\n何事同心人，一去邈难招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29048,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写厅壁桃源图","author":"熊卓","text":"圣皇御海宇，邈无夷夏分。\n群才争洗濯，凤凰游中原。\n乘时佐休治，史籍腾清芬。\n闻有武陵源，流水隔尘喧。\n当时避秦者，此地忘朝曛。\n花飞嵓畔雨，月落松间云。\n引领无翊戴，低头麋鹿群。\n住世长子孙，徒喧晋宋文。\n悠悠竟芜没，遗踪安足论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29049,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋同献吉诸公登镜光阁是夜无月","author":"熊卓","text":"群驺驾言返，暮霏拥林塘。\n出寺复入寺，嬉游殊未央。\n支公素耽客，展席临中堂。\n银膏照四壁，团月出未光。\n迟迟动深酌，语静闻啼螀。\n爰以结欢好，婉㜻金玉章。\n愿为云中鹤，比翼同翱翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29050,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野坪为冯治之作","author":"熊卓","text":"古树蔼丛薄，修原带郊坰。\n悠悠天容展，瀰瀰地势萦。\n桑麻荫其中，朝暮闻雉鸣。\n游者终良辰，樵牧日营营。\n倦翼集幽林，归云野墅横。\n游子抱真性，念此动高情。\n宠盛功弗居，终以托吾生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29051,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁晏和仲默韵","author":"熊卓","text":"天涯寥落客，岁晚独含思。\n白日当空速，归云带雪迟。\n风烟怜去住，节物怆心期。\n对酒那能乐，摅怀一赋诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29052,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送献吉归里","author":"熊卓","text":"相送转惆怅，天寒闻暮钟。\n高鸟去不息，浮云来几重。\n河关经旧垒，墟里对孤松。\n结束平原骑，翩翩塞北逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29053,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和复李献吉怀韵","author":"熊卓","text":"暂出边关道，亲交念别群。\n新芜炎雨长，远树夕阳分。\n路险平连塞，屯閒乱点云。\n无眠山馆夜，惆怅正思君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29054,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上元和廷实韵兼怀献吉","author":"熊卓","text":"今夕复何夕，千门候月明。\n浮云生汉苑，积雪霁秦京。\n漏下车尘暗，宫中火树晴。\n美人一水隔，伫望泪盈盈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29055,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王衍之还陜和廷实韵","author":"熊卓","text":"绕绕郊门道，沙寒驿路微。\n烟花行客晚，京洛故人稀。\n野岫孤云没，春山独鸟归。\n秦川隐关塞，一望一沾衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29056,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见白发有感","author":"熊卓","text":"四十年馀添白发，却因头白忆青春。\n初缘愁病斑斑出，自落风尘种种新。\n已讶入梳纷满面，每于临镜一伤神。\n官途役役羞看汝，勋业犹惭报主身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29057,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观江涨咏怀","author":"熊卓","text":"拍江忽传春水涨，柴扉即傍浪花开。\n帆冲急雨篱前落，鸥逐奔涛树里来。\n已被风光时引眺，况多愁病独登台。\n欲行何处有舟楫，迟日蘋风生野哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29058,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春","author":"熊卓","text":"岁前三日春归早，庭树东风款款吹。\n野屋尚稀花照眼，江门应有鲙鱼丝。\n高堂云物供时赏，久客山川动远思。\n短世行藏方自爱，任教斑鬓渐差差。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29059,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用前韵怀友","author":"熊卓","text":"幽栖白鸟甘分席，浊酒春风只掩门。\n谷口岂无停骥宅，南阳实有卧龙村。\n高天野寺烟花豁，细雨河桥草树浑。\n多病独愁稀会面，古来交道与谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29060,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓大寺留题","author":"熊卓","text":"今朝方外堪乘兴，廿载江湖只梦思。\n老去烟花休浪笑，向来猿鹤果相疑。\n松根草坐春从暖，竹里溪行昼每迟。\n世虑久知非我意，人间何物更多岐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29061,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日过南湖小馆","author":"熊卓","text":"西风落叶冷侵衣，坐倦江楼思入微。\n鸟逐午云过竹径，鸥翻秋水上苔矶。\n閒花幽草各自媚，社燕宾鸿相背飞。\n自分心情浑吏隐，风光传语莫相疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29062,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈文鸣","author":"熊卓","text":"潇湘从古称佳境，冥漠江湖梦见之。\n竹浦娟娟风色净，花垣苒苒昼光迟。\n香轮芳草客未倦，短笛孤舟人更吹。\n独有美人图画里，楚天烟水总堪思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29063,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除日杂怀","author":"熊卓","text":"孤城晓角清霜度，近市柴门旭日开。\n羌笛戍关情欲断，兰桡沙际首空回。\n风尘荏苒催蓬鬓，云物凄凉恋古台。\n却忆帝乡仙驭远，漫天雨露不胜哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29064,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登翠华岩","author":"熊卓","text":"胜地来过双眼明，翠华岩上春日晴。\n水禽飞来浦溆静，山郭浮近川湖平。\n浓花古洞幽幽发，细雨寒原黯黯生。\n游宦偶然耽野趣，题诗长忆谢宣城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29065,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送同寅郭鲁瞻犒戎宣府同廷实伯明","author":"熊卓","text":"袅袅垂杨拂御沟，青青芳杜遍春洲。\n三关路接边城迥，独树云移使节幽。\n月映寒塘生远梦，莺啼深院乱新愁。\n丈夫早试安边策，坐制河山百二秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29066,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送顾进士使浙纂修","author":"熊卓","text":"漠漠江湖生远愁，青青兰杜绕芳洲。\n烟林对酒浓花发，夕馆怀人长汉流。\n吴下清风过旧宅，越中啼鸟伴行舟。\n公馀定自多词赋，司马才高更胜游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29067,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春","author":"熊卓","text":"紫阁晴云流复道，竹门初日丽芳尘。\n篱前雪水绕村白，湖上柳条垂路新。\n冷雨凄霜应却避，流莺乳燕漫逢辰。\n独怜汉使浮槎近，翘首星河万象春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29068,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"巡广过家朱君佐设饮寺中有赠用其韵复之时君佐书考北上","author":"熊卓","text":"野堂高会麦秋天，忆共攀花十二年。\n座对薰弦如昨梦，棹迎芳草又离筵。\n乘时鸾凤云霄立，抱日鱼龙泽国眠。\n只恐天涯来雁少，瘴乡秋色渺风烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29069,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱君佐应朝北上","author":"熊卓","text":"花封暂假金闺彦，棨戟遥临剑水清。\n芳草几年劳别梦，寒云十月倍离情。\n居人愁望青凫远，仙侣同飞彩鹢轻。\n贾谊定应前席问，经纶知不负苍生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29070,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游感山用老杜韵","author":"熊卓","text":"野寺来游记往年，入门流水漫潺湲。\n交游白首怜谁在，尘路青山有梦传。\n禅榻卧云疑隔世，暮钟闻浦未回船。\n春潮来往君休问，无事沙鸥只晏眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29071,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人约往看菊","author":"熊卓","text":"爱汝野亭风日幽，寒花石路晚云稠。\n关心异品虚看谱，满目清霜可负秋。\n仙侣自应吟阆圃，儒衣能许坐寒流。\n草堂空闭閒风雨，为惜年芳易白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29072,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和献吉晚出禁闼","author":"熊卓","text":"遥望朱门启，宫花映绣盘。\n年年春二月，燕子入长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29073,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日谒陵途中","author":"熊卓","text":"耳畔闻啼鸟，悠悠客路情。\n山城春共远，花发不知名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29074,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客城南","author":"熊卓","text":"杨柳河桥馆，春风倒玉壶。\n离情不可道，江路满蘼芜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29075,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客南还有感","author":"熊卓","text":"遥望城南道，青青草色新。\n春风生锦棹，时送楚江人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29076,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出居庸","author":"熊卓","text":"沙上望行人，日暮愁心绝。\n江南四时春，边地五月雪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29077,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀友","author":"熊卓","text":"驿路连云暗，溪朝带月浑。\n美人不可见，此夜欲销魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29078,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中口占","author":"熊卓","text":"乱石苍松径，蔼蔼春风和。\n白云不作雨，空占碧山阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29079,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山西郊闻莺","author":"熊卓","text":"冉冉郊西路，繁烟弄柳条。\n东风殊解意，催送鸟声娇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29080,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春水和杜子韵效其体","author":"熊卓","text":"何处水来骤尔强，涨号彻夜谁能当。\n开门江槛已不见，几个轻鸥浮席傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29081,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经姑苏有感","author":"熊卓","text":"阖闾城边回短棹，行行烟柳入江皋。\n萋迷碧草吴宫里，春色年年发绛桃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29082,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别家","author":"孟洋","text":"仆夫早严驾，行行之楚乡。\n依依恋故里，尊俎临道傍。\n亲友偕集送，儿女泣成行。\n邻国非遐征，岁月未可量。\n白露涂郊原，秋草日焜黄。\n沙禽并栖宿，鸿雁东西翔。\n且为斯须留，日晚途路长。\n不云行役苦，徒令居者伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29083,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿华阴怀马侍御按节河中","author":"孟洋","text":"客路倦兹游，空堂此何夕。\n明灯促簿书，春星动檐隙。\n渭北鸿雁来，猿吟华山侧。\n浊流一何深，佳人杳难即。\n遥遥钦德音，茫茫阻颜色。\n笑言故山庐，繁华忆畴昔。\n皎月照岩阿，凝霜肃荆棘。\n萧萧骢马鸣，豺狼遁其迹。\n岂不慰遐思，终焉感离析。\n思欲往从之，安能生羽翮。\n临风缄素书，书短不盈尺。\n上言加餐饭，下言崇明德。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29084,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贻友人","author":"孟洋","text":"清云度高汉，落日下远戍。\n行子倦孤征，税驾咸阳暮。\n空林宿雨微，虚檐滴松露。\n怅然怀美人，昔语今不晤。\n浊酒谁为倾，强歌未成趣。\n岂无四海士，新交不如故。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29085,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王子衡巡按陜西得倚字","author":"孟洋","text":"孤鸿游八极，日暮宿江沚。\n纷纷四海士，缅怀念君子。\n逍遥幽涧滨，采摘多芳芷。\n嘉晤苦岁迟，乖别遽千里。\n商飙肃秋林，祖席临寒涘。\n谅子平生亲，赠言岂在累。\n初冬出函谷，饮马黄河水。\n巉崖走虎兕，夹道生荆杞。\n莫邪鸣鞘中，一日再三视。\n试以宽髀宜，众理良独耻。\n仰瞻太华巅，霜峰碧空倚。\n丈夫处两间，气槩谅可拟。\n三边堠火连，汉南寇蜂起。\n折冲贵笑谈，何必任锋矢。\n愿言树名勋，慰我贻尺鲤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29086,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郭侍御北还","author":"孟洋","text":"扬旌渡河渭，弭节览周秦。\n灵台岂经始，古道多荆榛。\n历险迫嵓谷，乘危犯沙尘。\n冷冷清风激，霜月鉴幽沦。\n豺虎潜故踪，狸鼠安足论。\n中衢有欢颂，穷檐无苦呻。\n鞭笞非所恃，风俾江汉淳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29087,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]